What is Airflow? 
Airflow is open source framework that is used for orchestration purpose.
Orchestration is process that automate workflow. 

What Airflow is not?
It is not an ETL Framework, It is not real time data processing system. 

Airflow VS Python Script
Airflow is a workflow that is directed, acyclic and graph and sometimes it involves execution of parallel task during workflow. 
Python script will also create workflow but it executes task one by one. Parallel task execution not possible in python script. 

